            "review_title": "Review at Layla Cafe & Bistro",
            "review_text": "Passenger573030\n5 contributions\n0\nNice coffee shop in HCM\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nI'm quite surprised that Ho Chi Minh City has a Gen restaurant that's so peaceful and pleasant. The food has authentic Northern flavors and is really delicious. I especially tried the chicken pho and xoi xeo with chicken, and my friend had the stir-fried pho with turtle tendon, which was absolutely delicious, just like in Hanoi's Old Quarter. The space is cool and relaxing, and the café has a unique, spacious resort-like atmosphere.\nRead more\nWritten February 24, 2025",
